# Compute a two-by-two inverse entry using its cofactor and the original determinant guard.
forall A matrix(C,2,2):
    det(A,2) != 0
    =>:
        matrix_inverse(A,2)(1,2) = matrix_cofactor(A,2,2,1) / det(A,2)
        matrix_cofactor(A,2,2,1) = -A(1,2)
        matrix_inverse(A,2)(1,2) = -A(1,2) / det(A,2)
